        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"e30aae6c-4925-4268-835a-2165840d64a7\",\"review_text\":\"I would rate 5 but without premium you should still be able to play music without shuffle\"},{\"review_id\":\"4c5ba668-126e-4631-931a-c84afa7c97ef\",\"review_text\":\"Los anuncios que hay en los podcast son muy molestos, cuál es el punto de pagar premium si van a estar poniendo de 2 a 3 anuncios por episodio de podcast?\"},{\"review_id\":\"4fdab5b7-6cd4-4bb9-be92-8fe58474d2cc\",\"review_text\":\"Superb music experience\"},{\"review_id\":\"fe0f86a5-b5e3-4ff1-a09f-8539def3d354\",\"review_text\":\"This app is Hella good go ahead and download it , if it's not installed in your mobile then just smash it it is useless if this app is not on your phone🤷\"},{\"review_id\":\"d19b84b8-f21d-4d66-8996-1d467bff2151\",\"review_text\":\"I love this music app except for the ads if you aint on premiu\"},{\"review_id\":\"a55ef929-df16-436b-84e5-92d41fe9499a\",\"review_text\":\"Very nice app but please return the enhance button for liked songs\"},{\"review_id\":\"d0b1f4d2-95d4-4966-9a9e-b0c7e05b1f9a\",\"review_text\":\"Just buy premium mini for 25₹ (7 days) and it's Amazing\"},{\"review_id\":\"c7893519-0e95-4aff-9b1e-f66270647a32\",\"review_text\":\"Bad experience with latest update ☹️...i am downloading different music app\"},{\"review_id\":\"e9ce41c8-2c7d-4abf-b37b-fb55f390b2ca\",\"review_text\":\"Great service. I used Deezer before and I can confidently say that Spotify is better than Deezer. I reduced my rating to 4 because the service does not provide a family subscription option in our country.\"},{\"review_id\":\"250f7496-03e0-435c-b67b-246a78747745\",\"review_text\":\"(Update) I reinstalled and that fixed it. Sorry for the harsh review.\"}]}"
